# Predator Ooze: "dealt damage by this creature this turn dies" is not only combat deaths (CR 603.2). Hill Giant blocks the attacking Ooze
# and takes 2; after combat Bot1 Shocks the Giant (Mox Ruby), 2 more damage kills it, and the Ooze gets a second counter (3/3).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Predator Ooze
Mox Ruby
Shock
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mountain
Hill Giant
Island x20

